WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.701
-Enjoy yourself.
Welcome, welcome, welcome

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.934
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:05.868
You're here. You made it.

00:00:05.868 --> 00:00:08.367
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you for watching!

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:09.868
Well, guys, it seems like
there's so much

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:11.367
going on right now this week.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.200
Former President Trump
was arrested

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.534
and charged here in New York.

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:17.000
Plus...

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:24.501
Plus, Easter is on Sunday.

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:27.767
The new "Super Mario Bros."
movie is now in theaters.

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:30.100
And I just heard the NBA says

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.367
it will no longer test players
for weed.

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:34.467
-Ooh.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.901
-There's a lot to go over,
so let's just jump in

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:39.400
and cover it all at once.
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:45.834
First up, Trump's arrest.

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:48.934
He's facing 34 charges
related to hush-money payments.

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:51.133
He's in real trouble, and
every time he opens his mouth

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:53.534
to talk about the case,
his lawyers say...

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.501
Jesus.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:57.434
That's who Easter's all about.

00:00:57.434 --> 00:00:58.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:00.601
Families come together
to celebrate.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:01.767
And, of course, on Sunday,

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:04.000
the Easter Bunny
will show up and shout...

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.601
"It's a-me."
That's Mario's catchphrase.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:10.234
And you can hear it in the all
new "Super Mario Bros. Movie."

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:11.868
I hope there's a scene
on Rainbow Road.

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:14.267
Flying down that colorful track
makes you feel...

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:16.467
high as a kite.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.467 --> 00:01:18.234
That's what you can be
in the NBA

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:21.033
because they're no longer
testing players for marijuana.

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:22.667
It's crazy to think
a couple years ago

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:24.100
smoking weed could land you...

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.234
in jail.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:29.501
Trump pled not guilty
on Tuesday,

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:31.267
but as the judge
read the charges,

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:34.467
it became pretty clear that his
best legal defense is to...

00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:36.634
pray.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:37.968
I really hope the Easter Bunny
brings me

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:39.868
some Easter chocolate
and marshmallow Peeps.

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:40.934
That would be so...

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.300
dope.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.934
Yeah, marijuana
is fair game now.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.801
So after every game, the teams
are gonna head to White...

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.701
Castle -- that's where
Peach lives -- in a castle.

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:53.133
This movie can make
175 million bucks

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.300
in one weekend.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.601
Wow.
Nobody's made so much money

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:56.934
in so little time since...

00:01:56.934 --> 00:02:00.267
Stormy Daniels.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.501
Trump gave her hush money
for their one-night stand,

00:02:02.501 --> 00:02:04.934
but she still told everyone
that his junk looks like...

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:07.701
a mushroom, kind of like Toad,

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:09.234
who's in the movie,
and so is Yoshi.

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:11.801
Maybe we'll see him hatch from
one of his famous green...

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:12.834
eggs.

00:02:12.834 --> 00:02:14.234
Kids put them
in their Easter baskets,

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.133
along with candy, presents
and, of course...

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:17.801
grass.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:20.067
In conclusion, karts are driven,

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:22.634
big decision, he is risen.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:24.100
Have fun in prison.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.133
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:28.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.601
♪♪

00:02:31.601 --> 00:02:33.701
That's right.

00:02:33.701 --> 00:02:35.968
Trump's arrest was
the big story of the week.

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:38.434
And I saw that it gave
all the cable news networks

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:40.667
a massive spike in ratings.

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:43.067
The anchors on CNN
were so excited, they were like,

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:45.634
"Wait. People can see me?"

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:47.767
Meanwhile, after visiting
New York to protest

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.400
Trump's arrest, Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.634
called the city
a terrible place

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:55.100
that is disgusting,
filthy, and repulsive.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.734
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:58.868
But don't worry.
Things got a lot better here

00:02:58.868 --> 00:03:00.534
after she left.

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:02.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:04.200
We're good now. We're back.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.934
Some big sports news.
Today in Augusta, Georgia,

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:11.601
the Masters golf tournament
kicked off.

00:03:11.601 --> 00:03:13.300
It's just nice
to see someone get hushed

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:16.367
without being paid $130,000.

00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:19.067
Well, this is cool. Meta
just shared a new A.I. model

00:03:19.067 --> 00:03:21.901
that can detect objects
that it's never seen before.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.701
Yeah, stuff
it's never seen before,

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:27.934
like Bigfoot
or the Loch Ness Monster

00:03:27.934 --> 00:03:30.701
or someone as beautiful as you.

00:03:30.701 --> 00:03:33.033
Come here often? Me neither.

00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:35.567
Sorry. My shoe's untied.
Just kidding.

00:03:35.567 --> 00:03:39.267
But now that I'm down here...
marry me?

00:03:39.267 --> 00:03:41.934
We could live in a little house
by the sea.

00:03:41.934 --> 00:03:44.033
Laugh. Cry. Grow old together.

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:45.567
Your memory will go,
but every day,

00:03:45.567 --> 00:03:47.467
I'll tell you the story
of how we met.

00:03:47.467 --> 00:03:49.501
And for one brief moment,
we'll dance again.

00:03:49.501 --> 00:03:51.734
We'll die in our sleep,
holding hands.

00:03:51.734 --> 00:03:53.167
"Welcome to heaven,"
God will say.

00:03:53.167 --> 00:03:55.067
"But I'm afraid
I can't let you guys in."

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.167
"What?"
"You didn't post enough.

00:03:57.167 --> 00:03:58.734
You barely poked anyone.

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:02.067
And your profile pictures,
they're all from 2013."

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:03.801
And that's when we'll realize...

00:04:03.801 --> 00:04:05.901
he's immortal, he's all-knowing.

00:04:05.901 --> 00:04:08.968
Yup, that's right.
God is Meta AI.

00:04:08.968 --> 00:04:11.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:14.501 --> 00:04:15.968
Did you guys see this?

00:04:15.968 --> 00:04:17.667
