landing in three minutes.

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:11.901
I want to make sure
I'm home before 'Jeopardy!'"

00:05:11.901 --> 00:05:13.801
And, finally,
speaking of pilots,

00:05:13.801 --> 00:05:16.000
I heard about a pilot
who was able to safely land

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:21.067
